🔴🟡🟢 Final Project
Your opportunity to build something of your own. No restrictions on language, topic, or scope — as long as it draws on what you learned in CS50.

Requirements
•	Implemented in any language(s)
•	Must reflect CS50 course content
•	Short video demo (~2 minutes) uploaded to YouTube
•	A README.md describing what your project does and how
•	Submitted via submit.cs50.io

Tips
•	Start small — a focused, working project beats an ambitious broken one
•	Pick something you'd actually use or share
•	The README matters — write it as if explaining to someone unfamiliar with your project

